(batch-case-extension)
*trajectory 1 case_vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=100 alt=0 lat=0 long=0 vel=1 gama=90 psi=90
  *segment 1 flight
    *when time>1 stop

*optimize a for vel=max on segment 1, trajectory 1
  par-1=launch_azimuth lo-1=-180 hi-1=180 ref-1=90

*cases
  case launch_lat launch_long target_lat target_long
  1 22.0 -159.8 39.5 -175.5
  2 35.0 -106.5 37.0 -83.05

*summarize apogee decm=0
  add maxfit(alt[1])
  add alt[1], on segment 1
*summarize final_lat decm=5
  add last(latgd[1])
*end
